{"additional":"","additionalPlain":"","categories":{"commitment":"Full Time","department":"Corporate","location":"Manila, Philippines","team":"Corporate","allLocations":["Manila, Philippines"]},"createdAt":1712686910602,"descriptionPlain":"Onboarding Specialist\n \nWing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies across the world. We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams & place their operations on autopilot.\n \nThe Role\nThe Onboarding Specialist will be in charge of facilitating new team member interviews with prospective customers by collecting video interviews from candidates and successfully distributing them to prospects.The objective of the job is to ensure that we are able to not only understand customer demand but also provide the most adequate candidates to all of Wing’s customers.\n \nDuties and Responsibilities\n- Engage with customers to understand their ideal candidate and process their plan inquiries\n- Record ad-hoc questions for video interviews using Videoask\n- Collect video interview answers from candidates and ensure that the quality meets our requirements\n- Work with sales and recruitment to ensure that we not only have the right requirements but that we are able to provide candidates that meet the prospect’s criteria in their entirety\n- Coordinate with recruitment to generate video interviews\n \n \nRequired Experience\n- 2 years of experience in any of the following areas: Onboarding, Customer Success, Client Management, Recruiting, Professional Staffing\n- Experience speaking to candidates and conducting high-volume interviews\n- Experience with video conferencing software and using it to conduct interviews\n- Experience working with customers to understand their needs and coordinating with multiple parties to ensure demand is met\n- Must have the ability to professionally communicate with prospects in the English language\n \nNice to Have\n \nExperience in the global outsourcing industry\nExperience working as a full-cycle recruiter and sourcing high-quality candidates\nExperience working with online meeting platform skills (Google Meet, Zoom, or Skype)and possess strong calendar management skills\nCritical thinking skills, attention to detail, strong verbal and written communication in English\nConfident, coachable, and enthusiastic team player who thrives in a fast-moving environment\n \nJob Type: Full-time\n \nSalary: Php25,000.00 - Php30,000.00\n \nBenefits:\nOpportunities for promotion\nPaid training\nPay raise\nWork from home\n \n \nLanguage:\nEnglish Professionally (Required)\n \n","description":"<div><strong>Onboarding Specialist</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Wing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies across the world. We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams &amp; place their operations on autopilot.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>The Role</strong></div>\n<div>The Onboarding Specialist will be in charge of facilitating new team member interviews with prospective customers by collecting video interviews from candidates and successfully distributing them to <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://prospects.The\" class=\"postings-link\">prospects.The</a> objective of the job is to ensure that we are able to not only understand customer demand but also provide the most adequate candidates to all of Wing’s customers.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Duties and Responsibilities</strong></div>\n<div>- Engage with customers to understand their ideal candidate and process their plan inquiries</div>\n<div>- Record ad-hoc questions for video interviews using Videoask</div>\n<div>- Collect video interview answers from candidates and ensure that the quality meets our requirements</div>\n<div>- Work with sales and recruitment to ensure that we not only have the right requirements but that we are able to provide candidates that meet the prospect’s criteria in their entirety</div>\n<div>- Coordinate with recruitment to generate video interviews</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Required Experience</strong></div>\n<div>- 2 years of experience in any of the following areas: Onboarding, Customer Success, Client Management, Recruiting, Professional Staffing</div>\n<div>- Experience speaking to candidates and conducting high-volume interviews</div>\n<div>- Experience with video conferencing software and using it to conduct interviews</div>\n<div>- Experience working with customers to understand their needs and coordinating with multiple parties to ensure demand is met</div>\n<div>- Must have the ability to professionally communicate with prospects in the English language</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Nice to Have</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Experience in the global outsourcing industry</div>\n<div>Experience working as a full-cycle recruiter and sourcing high-quality candidates</div>\n<div>Experience working with online meeting platform skills (Google Meet, Zoom, or Skype)and possess strong calendar management skills</div>\n<div>Critical thinking skills, attention to detail, strong verbal and written communication in English</div>\n<div>Confident, coachable, and enthusiastic team player who thrives in a fast-moving environment</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Job Type</strong>: Full-time</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Salary</strong>: Php25,<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://000.00\" class=\"postings-link\">000.00</a> - Php30,<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://000.00\" class=\"postings-link\">000.00</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits</strong>:</div>\n<div>Opportunities for promotion</div>\n<div>Paid training</div>\n<div>Pay raise</div>\n<div>Work from home</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Language</strong>:</div>\n<div>English Professionally (Required)</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","id":"dfaeb5f2-dfe0-4547-ae70-5c192b220093","lists":[],"salaryRange":{"currency":"PHP","min":25000,"interval":"per-month-salary","max":30000},"salaryDescription":"<div><strong>Salary</strong>: - Php25,000&nbsp;<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://0.0.0.0/\" class=\"postings-link\"> </a>Php30,000</div>","salaryDescriptionPlain":"Salary: - Php25,000 Php30,000\n","text":"Onboarding Specialist","country":"PH","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"","openingPlain":"","descriptionBody":"<div><strong>Onboarding Specialist</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Wing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies across the world. We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams &amp; place their operations on autopilot.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>The Role</strong></div>\n<div>The Onboarding Specialist will be in charge of facilitating new team member interviews with prospective customers by collecting video interviews from candidates and successfully distributing them to <a class=\"postings-link\" href=\"http://prospects.The\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">prospects.The</a> objective of the job is to ensure that we are able to not only understand customer demand but also provide the most adequate candidates to all of Wing&rsquo;s customers.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Duties and Responsibilities</strong></div>\n<div>- Engage with customers to understand their ideal candidate and process their plan inquiries</div>\n<div>- Record ad-hoc questions for video interviews using Videoask</div>\n<div>- Collect video interview answers from candidates and ensure that the quality meets our requirements</div>\n<div>- Work with sales and recruitment to ensure that we not only have the right requirements but that we are able to provide candidates that meet the prospect&rsquo;s criteria in their entirety</div>\n<div>- Coordinate with recruitment to generate video interviews</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Required Experience</strong></div>\n<div>- 2 years of experience in any of the following areas: Onboarding, Customer Success, Client Management, Recruiting, Professional Staffing</div>\n<div>- Experience speaking to candidates and conducting high-volume interviews</div>\n<div>- Experience with video conferencing software and using it to conduct interviews</div>\n<div>- Experience working with customers to understand their needs and coordinating with multiple parties to ensure demand is met</div>\n<div>- Must have the ability to professionally communicate with prospects in the English language</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Nice to Have</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Experience in the global outsourcing industry</div>\n<div>Experience working as a full-cycle recruiter and sourcing high-quality candidates</div>\n<div>Experience working with online meeting platform skills (Google Meet, Zoom, or Skype)and possess strong calendar management skills</div>\n<div>Critical thinking skills, attention to detail, strong verbal and written communication in English</div>\n<div>Confident, coachable, and enthusiastic team player who thrives in a fast-moving environment</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Job Type</strong>: Full-time</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Salary</strong>: Php25,<a class=\"postings-link\" href=\"http://000.00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">000.00</a> - Php30,<a class=\"postings-link\" href=\"http://000.00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">000.00</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits</strong>:</div>\n<div>Opportunities for promotion</div>\n<div>Paid training</div>\n<div>Pay raise</div>\n<div>Work from home</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Language</strong>:</div>\n<div>English Professionally (Required)</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"Onboarding Specialist\n \nWing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies across the world. We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams & place their operations on autopilot.\n \nThe Role\nThe Onboarding Specialist will be in charge of facilitating new team member interviews with prospective customers by collecting video interviews from candidates and successfully distributing them to prospects.The objective of the job is to ensure that we are able to not only understand customer demand but also provide the most adequate candidates to all of Wing’s customers.\n \nDuties and Responsibilities\n- Engage with customers to understand their ideal candidate and process their plan inquiries\n- Record ad-hoc questions for video interviews using Videoask\n- Collect video interview answers from candidates and ensure that the quality meets our requirements\n- Work with sales and recruitment to ensure that we not only have the right requirements but that we are able to provide candidates that meet the prospect’s criteria in their entirety\n- Coordinate with recruitment to generate video interviews\n \n \nRequired Experience\n- 2 years of experience in any of the following areas: Onboarding, Customer Success, Client Management, Recruiting, Professional Staffing\n- Experience speaking to candidates and conducting high-volume interviews\n- Experience with video conferencing software and using it to conduct interviews\n- Experience working with customers to understand their needs and coordinating with multiple parties to ensure demand is met\n- Must have the ability to professionally communicate with prospects in the English language\n \nNice to Have\n \nExperience in the global outsourcing industry\nExperience working as a full-cycle recruiter and sourcing high-quality candidates\nExperience working with online meeting platform skills (Google Meet, Zoom, or Skype)and possess strong calendar management skills\nCritical thinking skills, attention to detail, strong verbal and written communication in English\nConfident, coachable, and enthusiastic team player who thrives in a fast-moving environment\n \nJob Type: Full-time\n \nSalary: Php25,000.00 - Php30,000.00\n \nBenefits:\nOpportunities for promotion\nPaid training\nPay raise\nWork from home\n \n \nLanguage:\nEnglish Professionally (Required)\n \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/getwingapp/dfaeb5f2-dfe0-4547-ae70-5c192b220093","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/getwingapp/dfaeb5f2-dfe0-4547-ae70-5c192b220093/apply"}